{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_08",
  "title": "沙灘阻擊",
  "storyCode": "DH-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b6420ee7350f48efe67d61e871165340dfaa8e2390917040a7749fcbf04268c2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咦，節目的內部線路怎麼接不上了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是......被佔用了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "十年前，我相信只要把聯合政府和辛嘉斯王朝都趕出去，玻利瓦爾就會獲得和平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我為了真正玻利瓦爾人打生打死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "最後，我三千個弟兄被我帶去送死，如果不是我的老哥哥豁出性命，我那天就被槍決了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "從那天起，我就明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "聯合政府，辛嘉斯王朝的貴族們，真正玻利瓦爾人，這三個沒有一個真的想要拯救玻利瓦爾，他們只是在打仗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們再打多少年，玻利瓦爾也不會有救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為了避難，我逃到了這座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然後，我發現，在這個已經沒救的國家裡，還有這樣一座沒救的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "坎黛拉·桑切斯，比他們所有人都更加不可救藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她在這片沒救的土地上建立了這座比所有玻利瓦爾城市加起來都要腐敗的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她不僅自己享受其中，還將其他人也拉到自己身邊和她一起享受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所有人都被她捲了進來，過著自以為體面的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們根本不知道這座城市的下水道裡流淌著多少惡臭的人血，飼養了多少的食腐餓獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她吸食著生活在這片土地上的人民的血肉，而絲毫不關心他們的死活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這座城市他媽的該死，在這裡享樂的你們也他媽的該死！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大獎賽結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "接下來，我會奪取這座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒人拯救這個國家，我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以你的父親才是這一切的主謀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當你發現我們有可能察覺到什麼的時候，你選擇將我們的注意力轉移到你的身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這樣，即使我們真的發現了什麼，你也為你背後的人爭取了時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的。我不想說我贏了，陳小姐，這本來就不是一場公平的較量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們來得太晚，接受坎黛拉女士的委託又太匆忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是我最後的善意，陳小姐，和林小姐投降吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "兩位要是願意收手，我保證沒有人會傷到你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這裡的事和你們無關，你們沒有必要參與到這樣一場沒有對錯可言的事情中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這艘船已經被我們的人佔領了，反抗的話，你和林小姐會死的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有個老朋友說過，只有被狠狠捶打過一遍，我才會像過去的她一樣，知道自己那些可笑的執著都不過是些衝動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我到現在也還沒有分清，哪些是可以堅持的執著，哪些是不切實際的衝動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但我想她應該也是知道的，如果因此我就不去做的話，我也就不叫陳暉潔了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "動手吧，我趕時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "震驚的男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，這不是潘喬先生嗎？他在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "震驚的女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不知道，是什麼特別演出嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哪裡來的爆炸聲？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好像是第一輪的城區那邊！你看，那邊冒煙了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂喂喂，不是吧，難道潘喬這個老頭是來真的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "坎黛拉女士，城內和郊區出現了多股不明勢力正在引發混亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嘖嘖，來這招啊，我的老潘喬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "坎黛拉女士，請前往安全的地方避難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "避難？說什麼呢，這裡可是頭等座，我哪裡都不會去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "城裡那些突然冒出來的傢伙隨便應付一下就好了，反正他們的目的最後都會是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，疏散群眾還是要做的，不過，城門先封閉了，讓他們都回到自己的住所去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然後嘛，把工作人員保護起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "讓他們籌備宴會，還有繼續進行大獎賽的轉播。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "保護好他們，別讓我的大獎賽被破壞了，明白了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對了對了，去調一批新的無人機來，船上的那些估計被他們破壞了，這麼有趣的事情，怎麼能錯過呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，不是吧，我們只是來度個假，還能遇到這種事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雖然應該說，這才有玻利瓦爾的感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別貧了，快想想怎麼辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Missy，我們現在只是遊客，管不了也不該管這麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是陳暉潔站在這裡，你會這麼對她說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "會啊，只是你也知道她的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那麼我的答案也是一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好吧，我只能說，我不反對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "羅德島......嘖，鑄鐵剛好去買飲料了，我去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且她們兩個現在還在船上呢，我怎麼可能放心走啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我倒是不怎麼擔心她們兩個就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且，我們是局外人，沒有感覺很正常，但是既然有這樣的事情發生，我不信老陳和林小姐會一無所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在也不知道船上具體的狀況，我們想要上船幫老陳她們也不太現實，還是做些力所能及的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客A？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客B？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘖，居然趁我雙手拿飲料的時候偷襲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（沒想到居然會發生這樣的事。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（對方看起來是有組織的，沙灘上已經陷入了混亂。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（現在武器也不在手邊，難以施展，先去和星熊她們會合......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客A？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一起上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客B？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鑄鐵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝了，星熊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "客氣。比起來，你算是這次的隊長，剛才你也聽到了，現在這個樣子，羅德島打算怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我現在正在休假中，只是一個路人，幫點忙應該不算什麼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈，我就猜到你會這麼說，那就一起吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "紅，你在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不知道。鑄鐵，人很多，有血的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道。你現在來沙灘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾雅法拉和蘇蘇洛需要你來保護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那邊有一夥人，他們沒有在後退......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們的方向是......市長那邊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "走，鑄鐵，攔住他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
